<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-10T23:36:32.342Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:36:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Manipur’s high court has extended the suspension of the census to April 2027 while the state government reports the recovery of over 4,000 firearms and the transfer of a Kuki youth murder case to the NIA, prompting the chief minister to meet victims' families and the home minister to pledge safe return of displaced persons. Police have finalized a plan to destroy illegal poppy plantations in 516 villages and the DGP has met tribal leaders and civil society groups to discuss security in Tamenglong. In Kashmir, a six-year-old boy was killed by a leopard in Baramulla and a 27-year-old man died when an unidentified vehicle struck his scooter in Srinagar. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92RzBLdGQ2TFB5c0RXT083SWs0UjhYekRuSVFTVVJYUktaaDh5UEk2LU5TTENtTW9TSTFaclUtWFpLQVRiX2Juc2ZFd2luSjdnbWRYb3Zyb0ZKMnNaOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQRkN5c2poVXVQRFhBUDd4aG9SVTRrZ2VIZk1ManFEbHpNb0RDVElmSU1fbGczXzdJOWh0U2pSaFpPZVBqZVdxZTA1dU1aWWduNk52RzloX3JFVUhob0w1WndtZmFPZW9temxNeFItVWI1emtBQTlpVTAwQ0pCbU5TcXJ4Sk5RaHlGSm0tTmFUT3gzb25wOUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Urban Acres&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Times Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQTnlHSmcxQ19XTndUNjd2M0dOb2s4eHl3eVRkWVlsemNUZERHX1hWUUtLUnV2U2RUWE5WTF90T0RrQTBtQ3lJc3RMOXZVUmNzbGVkZHJwVHEtcWQ5QTFVV29DQ3lYZEJoQmRUSGpaSlNGbXlqbkR2TGtYRWdtLW8tb1NfbzhUaTh4eFhEM2N3Qm8yc3dkN0FYMVRKcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Good Morning Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl